-----------------------------------------------------------------------------


        Setup commands used in the PREFERENCES for SCREENTYPES
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

NUMBER_SCREENTYPES       (pn)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Number of screentypes you want to use

NAMESCREENTYPE(n)        (pt)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Name of screentype

EXT_SCREENTYPE(n)        (pt)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Extension to add to textfiles with
                                  selected screentype
